      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "## Safety rules in this workflow\n- **Shadow mode** (Settings → shadowMode, default true): drafts on the right thread, nothing sent.\n- **Right thread or no send**: exactly one thread, else Slack a person. Never starts a new thread.\n- **Never twice**: key = job + status + window, checked against the Update Log.\n- **Quiet hours**: homeowners 8 PM–7 AM wait for the morning run. Vendors exempt.\n- **Customer replied?** Newest message unread and not from us → pause, Slack a person.\n- **Approve the first 5** of a new template: draft + Slack. A person sends it, then marks the log row approved.\n- Every Gmail, Sheets and Slack node retries 3 times."
